  nc-ai menu                           the text actions (Super + I): Spotlight on “!”, otherwise a menu
  nc-ai terminal QUESTION              the answer in a terminal (“?” in the Noctalia launcher, without the island)
  nc-ai file PATH… [ACTION|instruction] [--notifier]
                                       a text, code, a PDF or an image: summarized by default (right click in Files →
                                       Scripts → AI)
  nc-ai diagnostic                     what nc-diag found, explained, with what to do (nc-diag ia)
  nc-ai diagnostic --json [--delai S] [-]
                                       “What's going on?” (Spotlight): the nc-diag --json report (“-”: read from
                                       standard input, otherwise nc-diag --json --rapide) summarized, and its repairs
                                       put in order; a JSON {source, raison, ia, agent, resume, reparations, conseil,
